{"title":"Drop spa","description":"Outdoor spa from Finland","products":[{"product_id":"drop-vuolle-compact","title":"Drop Vuolle Compact","description":"\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSame amount of luxury in a smaller size. Drop Compact Series brings you the perfect combination of luxury and relaxation for smaller spaces.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWith massage seats for 3, and 24 massage jets, Drop Vuolle Compact brings you the same experience as our flagship models, in a smaller package, but without compromising our signature design and combination of features and adaptability.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAs with all Drop spas, Drop Vuolle Compact can also be embedded, fully or partially, to fit perfectly into your terrace or patio. Or you can install it on top of your terrace and cover the sides with beautiful paneling.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv hidden=\"\" class=\"accordion tablinks active\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eTECHNICAL DETAILS\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"teknisettiedot\" class=\"tab panel cpadding-s\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"col-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"solu129501\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e Technical details\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePeople capacity: 3-4\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide length: *190 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInner diameter: *171 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeight: *105,0 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImmersion depth: *97 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater capacity: 1500 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater use: 900-1200 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaterial: acrylic \/ reinforced plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight when empty: approx. 250 kg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eElectric connection: 3 x 16 A, 400V\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e+\/- 0,5cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eContents of the pool package\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv hidden=\"\" class=\"accordion tablinks active\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eCONTENTS OF THE POOL PACKAGE\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"sisalto\" class=\"tab panel cpadding-s\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"col-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"solu129511\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDrop spa pool in white or black\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminum frame\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3 kW electrical heating (6kW in Finland, Sweden, and Norway)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMassaging nozzle system: 24 nozzles, massage seats for three\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMassage pump 1.5 kW\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFilter system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED pool light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30 mm polyurethane insulation of the entire frame (50 mm in Finland, Sweden, and Norway)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInsulation cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUV system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOzonisation system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStarter kit of pool chemicals\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe pool technology is assembled and water-tested at the factory.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Drop","offers":[{"title":"Black \/ Cold","offer_id":39913691054404,"sku":"301220509","price":16800.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black \/ Temperate","offer_id":47717024923972,"sku":"301220508","price":16800.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White \/ Cold","offer_id":39913691087172,"sku":"301220209","price":16800.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White \/ Temperate","offer_id":47717024956740,"sku":"301220208","price":16800.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey \/ Cold","offer_id":39913691119940,"sku":"301220409","price":16800.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey \/ Temperate","offer_id":47717024989508,"sku":"301220408","price":16800.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Matte Black \/ Cold","offer_id":47717025022276,"sku":"301220559","price":16800.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Matte Black \/ Temperate","offer_id":47717025055044,"sku":"301220558","price":16800.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/0857\/4276\/products\/Drop_design-spa-rooftop-4-1-_309_368.jpg?v=1677687065"},{"product_id":"drop-vuolle","title":"Drop Vuolle","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ciframe title=\"YouTube video player\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/Ys6uT4QafBo?si=Hglpn6UuGnyBHNoH\" height=\"315\" width=\"560\" allowfullscreen=\"\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c\/iframe\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDrop Vuolle is a modern outdoor spa pool which combines Drop pool’s unfailing design with massaging nozzles and state-of-the-art outdoor spa technology. Vuolle outdoor spa pool is designed and made in Finland and guarantees a first-class bathing experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Finnish word Vuolle refers to a section of a river with a powerful stream, a steady flow, and whirlpools at the edges. In Drop Vuolle outdoor spa pool, you can sense the murmur of the river as the light plays on the water’s surface and enjoy the calming effect of the warm water. In addition to its low-key and stylish appearance, the massaging nozzles guarantee that Drop Vuolle is a holistic experience for all senses.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis pool package is true everyday luxury! The pool has massage seats for four and 32 massage nozzles. The pool fits up to eight bathers at the same time. The pool technology is assembled and water-tested at the factory.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe electrically-heated Drop pools are designed for year-round use and can be kept ready to use no matter the weather. Just open up the cover and enjoy!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"accordion tablinks active\" hidden=\"\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eTECHNICAL DETAILS\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"tab panel cpadding-s\" id=\"teknisettiedot\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"col-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"solu129501\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e Technical details\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePeople capacity: 6–8; massage seats for 4\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide length: *220 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInner diameter: *195 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeight: *105,0 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImmersion depth: *97 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight when empty: approx. 300 kg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaterial: acrylic \/ reinforced plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater capacity: 1830 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater use: 1,000–1,500 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eElectric connection: 3 x 16 A, 400V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eContents of the pool package\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"tab panel cpadding-s\" id=\"sisalto\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"col-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"solu126511\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDrop spa pool in white, grey or black\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminum frame\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3 kW electrical heating (6kW in Finland, Sweden, and Norway)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMassaging nozzle system\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e32 nozzles, massage seats for four\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMassage pump 1.5 kW\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFilter system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED pool light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30 mm polyurethane insulation of the entire frame (50 mm in Finland, Sweden, and Norway)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInsulation cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUV system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOzonisation system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStarter kit of pool chemicals\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Drop","offers":[{"title":"Black \/ Cold","offer_id":39913702261060,"sku":"301120509","price":18500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black \/ Temperate","offer_id":47717007065412,"sku":"301120508","price":18500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White \/ Cold","offer_id":39913702293828,"sku":"301120209","price":18500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White \/ Temperate","offer_id":47717007098180,"sku":"301120208","price":18500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey \/ Cold","offer_id":39913702326596,"sku":"301120409","price":18500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey \/ Temperate","offer_id":47717007130948,"sku":"301120408","price":18500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Matte Black \/ Cold","offer_id":47717007163716,"sku":"301120559","price":18500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Matte Black \/ Temperate","offer_id":47717007196484,"sku":"301120558","price":18500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/0857\/4276\/products\/Drop-design-spa-vuolle-product-SamuelTaipale2-1-_158_332.jpg?v=1677588650"},{"product_id":"drop-x","title":"Drop X","description":"\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur latest outdoor spa model, the Drop X, offers a luxurious bathing experience second to none. With room for up to eight people, massage seats for five, and a total of 46 massaging water nozzles, this state-of-the-art spa pool represents the absolute elite among our minimalist Drop Design Pools. It comes with all the amenities, including a control panel and an ozonization system.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eShaped like a drop, our Drop Design Pools are inspired by Finland’s beautiful nature, and their minimalistic design was created by Finnish designer Nikolai Ruola. Drop outdoor spas integrate seamlessly into any outdoor space, and they can be embedded in a terrace for an even more discreet look. These electrically heated outdoor spas are both designed and manufactured in Finland.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThere are few things more enjoyable than letting yourself sink into steaming hot water that nurtures your mind and body, taking a few deep breaths, and giving your body a break from the demands of your hectic life. Right there, just outside your beautiful home, surrounded by your loved ones and feeling perfectly well, relaxed and present at the moment.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv hidden=\"\" class=\"accordion tablinks active\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eTECHNICAL DETAILS\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"teknisettiedot\" class=\"tab panel cpadding-s\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"col-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"solu129501\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e Technical details\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePeople capacity: 6–8; massage seats for 6\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide length: *220 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInner diameter: *195 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeight: *105,0 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImmersion dept: *97 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater capacity: 1830 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater use: 1000-1500 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaterial: Acrylic\/ reinforced plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight: approx. 300 kg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eElectric connection: 3 x 16 A, 400V \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e+\/- 0,5cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eContents of the pool package\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDrop spa pool in white, grey or black\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminum frame\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3 kW electrical heating (6kW in Finland, Sweden, and Norway)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMassaging nozzle system\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e46 rotating massaging nozzles, massage seats for six\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMassage pump 2.2 kW\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFilter system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED pool light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-stringify-indent=\"0\"\u003eDigital control panel\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-stringify-indent=\"0\"\u003e30 mm polyurethane insulation of the entire frame (50 mm in Finland, Sweden, and Norway)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-stringify-indent=\"0\"\u003eInsulation cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUV system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOzonisation system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-stringify-indent=\"0\"\u003eStarter kit of pool chemicals\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"sisalto\" class=\"tab panel cpadding-s\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"col-full\"\u003e\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Drop","offers":[{"title":"Black \/ Temperate","offer_id":44553768010052,"sku":"301110508","price":21200.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black \/ Cold","offer_id":47716794827076,"sku":"301110509","price":21200.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White \/ Temperate","offer_id":44553768042820,"sku":"301110208","price":21200.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White \/ Cold","offer_id":47716794892612,"sku":"301110209","price":21200.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey \/ Temperate","offer_id":44553768075588,"sku":"301110408","price":21200.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey \/ Cold","offer_id":47716794925380,"sku":"301110409","price":21200.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Matte Black \/ Temperate","offer_id":47716794958148,"sku":"301110558","price":21200.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Matte Black \/ Cold","offer_id":47716794990916,"sku":"301110559","price":21200.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/0857\/4276\/products\/image_50e6f7ed-60f6-49db-af61-b3835aeb1107.jpg?v=1677687072"},{"product_id":"drop-s","title":"Drop S","description":"\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDrop S is a stylish outdoor spa that combines the minimalist design of the Drop pool with modern outdoor spa technology. Drop S outdoor spa pool is designed and made in Finland and guarantees a first-class bathing experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e The pool has massage seats for four and fits up to eight bathers at the same time. Drop S has 6” massage nozzles that guarantee just the right amount of relaxing water flow.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e The pool technology is assembled and water-tested at the factory.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e The electrically-heated Drop pools are designed for year-round use and can be kept ready to use no matter the weather. Just open up the cover and enjoy!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e  Technical details\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"tab panel cpadding-s\" id=\"teknisettiedot\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"col-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"solu129501\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePeople capacity: 6–8; massage seats for 4\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide length: *220 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInner diameter: *195 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeight: *105,0 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImmersion depth: *97 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight when empty: approx. 300 kg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaterial: acrylic \/ reinforced plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater capacity: 1830 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater use: 1,000–1,500 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eElectric connection: 3 x 16 A, 400V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e  +\/- 0,5cm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eContents of the pool package\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDrop spa pool in white, grey, or black\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminum frame\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3 kW electrical heating (6kW in Finland, Sweden, and Norway)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMassaging nozzle system\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4 pc of 6″ massage nozzles\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMassage pump \u003cspan class=\"JsGRdQ\"\u003e1,1 kW\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFilter system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED pool light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-stringify-indent=\"0\"\u003eDigital control panel\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-stringify-indent=\"0\"\u003e30 mm polyurethane insulation of the entire frame (50 mm in\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-stringify-indent=\"0\"\u003eInsulation cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUV system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOzonisation system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-stringify-indent=\"0\"\u003eStarter kit of pool chemicals\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"tab panel cpadding-s\" id=\"sisalto\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"col-full\"\u003e\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Drop","offers":[{"title":"Black \/ Temperate","offer_id":44553770139972,"sku":"301130508","price":15600.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black \/ Cold","offer_id":47717095113028,"sku":"301130509","price":15600.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White \/ Temperate","offer_id":44553770172740,"sku":"301130208","price":15600.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White \/ Cold","offer_id":47717095145796,"sku":"301130209","price":15600.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey \/ Temperate","offer_id":44553770205508,"sku":"301130408","price":15600.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey \/ Cold","offer_id":47717095211332,"sku":"301130409","price":15600.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Matte Black \/ Temperate","offer_id":47717095244100,"sku":"301130558","price":15600.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Matte Black \/ Cold","offer_id":47717095276868,"sku":"301130559","price":15600.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/0857\/4276\/products\/image_8246a027-836b-4dd2-92e6-ac6c24b7463c.jpg?v=1677687056"},{"product_id":"drop-lampi","title":"Drop Lampi","description":"\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDrop Lampi, which represents the beloved purity of the Finnish nature and the serenity and aesthetics of Lapland, is a beautiful haven of relaxation on your patio. The name Lampi is Finnish and refers to a pond. The still surface of the Lampi pool creates the perfect oasis for relaxing alone or in a larger group. The pool light perfects the mood on dark nights. The surface of the water ripples with sparkles as you unwind after your working day, under the midnight sun or lit by the Northern Lights.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe electrically heated Drop pools are designed for year-round use and can be kept ready to use no matter the weather. Just open up the cover and enjoy!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e  Technical details\u003cmet