":47718642352452,"sku":"","price":16850.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/0857\/4276\/products\/image_e8d50a4f-d567-47c9-853b-8109307ecff7.jpg?v=1677687026"},{"product_id":"drop-piasara","title":"Drop Pisara","description":"\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnjoy a wood-heated bath around the year!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe drop theme appears in both the design of the products as well as the name of the company. The first Drop spa pools came with a stove and, back then, it was the only available heating option. That’s why this pool package was named Pisara, which is Finnish for drop. It’s the pool that started everything.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e Pisara spa pool has an incredibly efficient and stylish Black Box stove with a heating time that only the top of the industry offers — approximately 2 hours. The bather can sense the heat of the stove, the smell of the chopped wood and the atmospheric flames behind the stove’s glass door.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis pool takes a traditional hot tub experience one drop further.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e  Technical details\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePeople capacity: 6–8\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide length: *220 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInner diameter: *195 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeight: *105 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImmersion depth: approx. *97 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight when empty: approx. 240 kg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaterial: reinforced plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater capacity: 1830 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater use: 1,000–1,500 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight of the stove: approx. 40 kg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e+\/- 0,5cm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 1.4em;\"\u003eContents of the pool package\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe package includes everything you need to use a traditional pool with a wood stove.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDrop spa pool in white, grey, or black\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePressure-treated wood frame for the pool\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e35 kW Black Box stove\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChimney and protective grill\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAsh spade\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED pool light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-stringify-indent=\"0\"\u003eInsulation cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAll necessary hoses and clamps for the stove.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n","brand":"Drop","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":44553776628036,"sku":"","price":9000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White","offer_id":44553776660804,"sku":"","price":9000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey","offer_id":44553776693572,"sku":"","price":9000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Matte Black","offer_id":47718763430212,"sku":"","price":9000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/0857\/4276\/products\/image_249a98b9-de06-4724-aaef-ab2e0d487e7a.jpg?v=1677687045"},{"product_id":"drop-lampi-compact","title":"Drop Lampi Compact","description":"\u003cp\u003eLampi Compact represents the beloved purity of the Finnish nature and the serenity and aesthetics of Lapland in a smaller size. It is a beautiful haven of relaxation on your patio. The name Lampi is Finnish and refers to a pond. The still surface of the Lampi pool creates the perfect oasis for relaxing alone or in a larger group. The pool light perfects the mood on dark nights. The surface of the water ripples with sparkles as you unwind after your working day, under the midnight sun or lit by the Northern Lights.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe electrically heated Drop spas are designed for year-round use and can be kept ready to use no matter the weather. Just open up the cover and enjoy!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"accordion tablinks active\" hidden=\"\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eTECHNICAL DETAILS\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"tab panel cpadding-s\" id=\"teknisettiedot\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"col-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"solu129501\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e Technical details\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePeople capacity: 3-4\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide length: *190 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInner diameter: *171 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeight: *105,0 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImmersion depth: *97 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater capacity: 1500 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater use: 900-1200 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaterial: acrylic \/ reinforced plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight when empty: approx. 250 kg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eElectric connection: 3 x 16 A, 400V\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e+\/- 0,5cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eContents of the pool package\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"accordion tablinks active\" hidden=\"\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eCONTENTS OF THE POOL PACKAGE\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"tab panel cpadding-s\" id=\"sisalto\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"col-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"solu129511\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDrop spa pool\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminum frame\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3 kW electrical heating (6kW in Finland, Sweden, and Norway)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFilter system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED pool light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30 mm polyurethane insulation of the entire frame (50 mm in Finland, Sweden, and Norway)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInsulation cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUV system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOzonisation system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStarter kit of pool chemicals\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Drop","offers":[{"title":"Black \/ Cold","offer_id":47718722535748,"sku":"301250509","price":11500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black \/ Temperate","offer_id":47718722568516,"sku":"301250508","price":11500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White \/ Cold","offer_id":47718722601284,"sku":"301250209","price":11500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White \/ Temperate","offer_id":47718722634052,"sku":"301250208","price":11500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey \/ Cold","offer_id":47718722666820,"sku":"301250409","price":11500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey \/ Temperate","offer_id":47718722699588,"sku":"301250408","price":11500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Matte Black \/ Cold","offer_id":47718722732356,"sku":"301250559","price":11500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Matte Black \/ Temperate","offer_id":47718722765124,"sku":"301250558","price":11500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/0857\/4276\/files\/Drop_design-spa-rooftop-4-1-_309_368_670404e9-88c3-47e5-b1e9-02615f7bab0a.jpg?v=1704307422"}],"url":"https:\/\/heatica.com\/collections\/drop-spa.oembed","provider":"Heatica","version":"1.0","type":"link"}